  - "tables/**"
alwaysApply: true
---

This is a LaTeX paper repository.

- Edit paper source in `main.tex`, `sections/*.tex`, and `references.bib`.
- Put figures in `figures/` and table/data assets in `tables/`.
- Do not edit generated files in `build/` or LaTeX auxiliary files such as `*.aux`, `*.log`, `*.bbl`, `*.blg`, `*.fls`, or `*.synctex.gz`.
- Use existing labels, citations, and section structure where possible.
- After edits, run `make doctor`. If LaTeX is installed, it will also verify `build/main.pdf`.
- For continuous writing sessions, prefer `make watch` because `latexmk` incrementally rebuilds only what changed.
- To migrate an existing LaTeX zip, use `make import-zip ZIP=/path/to/paper.zip`, then review `main.tex` and any imported files under `sections/`.
